      "subject": "וראשנות ישמיענו",
      "rationale": "Ol skul i no wankain: sam i ting 'ol samting bipo' (ol binbihain tok bilong profet olgeta i kamap tru), narapela i ting 'ol samting we i bin hapen bipo' — mi usim tok narapela."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "נקבצו \/ ויאספו",
      "rationale": "Tupela tok bilong 'kamap wan \/ karamap' i stap klostu — olsem wanpela singing, Tok Pisin i no inap holim olgeta."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "gentel",
      "rationale": "Yahwe i singautim ol gentel long kot — ol i ken bringim witness bilong skelim."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Olgeta ol gentel i kamap wan, ol lain i karamap wantaim; husat namel long ol bai autim dispela, na bilong taim bipo bai mekim ol yr long harim? Ol i mas givim ol witness bilong ol, na ol i ken skelim stret; sapos ol inap harim, ol bai tok: em i tru.",
